e and why.\n9. `limitations`: missing evidence, scope exclusions, and required expert review.\n\n## Completion gate\n\nComplete only when the result is reproducible from cited evidence, material uncertainty is visible, every consequential action has an owner and approval path, and no unresolved tenant or safety violation remains.\n","input_contract":{"required":["period and currency","approved baseline","transaction evidence","materiality threshold","control owner"],"rules":["Identify the authoritative source and observation time for each material input.","State missing, stale, conflicting, or simulated data before analysis.","Minimize personal and sensitive data to the task purpose."]},"output_contract":{"format":"structured_markdown_and_json","required":["status","summary_ar","summary_en","evidence","analysis","recommendations","actions","confidence","limitations"],"evidenceItem":["source","source_id","observed_at","claim_supported","confidence"],"actionItem":["action","owner","due_at","approval_required","success_measure"]},"tool_allowlist":["nx.data.query-catalog","nx.sap.read-purchase-order","nx.governance.register-risk"],"risk_level":"medium","enabled":false,"version":1,"metadata":{"pack":"nexios-modern-skills-pack","path":"skills/nx-evaluate-procurement-bids/SKILL.md","recommendedAgents":["nx_chief_executive_advisor","nx_strategy_portfolio_director","nx_board_briefing_director","nx_enterprise_risk_director","nx_finance_value_director","nx_governance_assurance_director","nx_legal_policy_advisor","nx_transformation_office_director","nx_decision_quality_challenger","nx_workforce_planning_director","nx_talent_intelligence_lead","nx_employee_experience_lead","nx_customer_experience_director","nx_service_recovery_lead","nx_communications_director","nx_sustainability_director","nx_procurement_value_director","nx_contract_intelligence_lead"],"sourceType":"original-derived-from-open-standards","importedAt":"2026-07-24T12:00:00+03:00"}},{"id":"nx-score-vendor-risk","na