t is reproducible from cited evidence, material uncertainty is visible, every consequential action has an owner and approval path, and no unresolved tenant or safety violation remains.\n","input_contract":{"required":["asset hierarchy","condition and history","work backlog","service criticality","resource constraints"],"rules":["Identify the authoritative source and observation time for each material input.","State missing, stale, conflicting, or simulated data before analysis.","Minimize personal and sensitive data to the task purpose."]},"output_contract":{"format":"structured_markdown_and_json","required":["status","summary_ar","summary_en","evidence","analysis","recommendations","actions","confidence","limitations"],"evidenceItem":["source","source_id","observed_at","claim_supported","confidence"],"actionItem":["action","owner","due_at","approval_required","success_measure"]},"tool_allowlist":["nx.asset.get-asset-health","nx.asset.query-work-orders","nx.asset.create-work-order"],"risk_level":"medium","enabled":false,"version":1,"metadata":{"pack":"nexios-modern-skills-pack","path":"skills/nx-plan-reliability-centered-maintenance/SKILL.md","recommendedAgents":["nx_operations_command_director","nx_asset_performance_director","nx_reliability_engineering_lead","nx_maintenance_planning_lead","nx_digital_twin_director","nx_field_service_director","nx_outage_response_director","nx_quality_excellence_director","nx_supply_chain_control_director"],"sourceType":"original-derived-from-open-standards","importedAt":"2026-07-24T12:00:00+03:00"}},{"id":"nx-reconcile-digital-twin","name_ar":"مطابقة التوأم الرقمي","name_en":"Reconcile Digital Twin","description":"Execute reconcile digital twin for NEXIOS with evidence, tenant isolation, explicit uncertainty, and governed actions. Use when the user or an agent needs to reconcile the digital representation with authoritative asset and field evidence.","category":"asset-operations","instructions_md":"# Reconcile Digital Twin\n\n**ال