terial uncertainty is visible, every consequential action has an owner and approval path, and no unresolved tenant or safety violation remains.\n","input_contract":{"required":["population and period","service or role","evidence sources","fairness constraints","accountable owner"],"rules":["Identify the authoritative source and observation time for each material input.","State missing, stale, conflicting, or simulated data before analysis.","Minimize personal and sensitive data to the task purpose."]},"output_contract":{"format":"structured_markdown_and_json","required":["status","summary_ar","summary_en","evidence","analysis","recommendations","actions","confidence","limitations"],"evidenceItem":["source","source_id","observed_at","claim_supported","confidence"],"actionItem":["action","owner","due_at","approval_required","success_measure"]},"tool_allowlist":["nx.data.query-catalog","nx.knowledge.search-corpus","nx.communications.draft-mail"],"risk_level":"low","enabled":false,"version":1,"metadata":{"pack":"nexios-modern-skills-pack","path":"skills/nx-assess-succession-risk/SKILL.md","recommendedAgents":[],"sourceType":"original-derived-from-open-standards","importedAt":"2026-07-24T12:00:00+03:00"}},{"id":"nx-identify-training-needs","name_ar":"تحديد الاحتياجات التدريبية","name_en":"Identify Training Needs","description":"Execute identify training needs for NEXIOS with evidence, tenant isolation, explicit uncertainty, and governed actions. Use when the user or an agent needs to map capability gaps to role outcomes, evidence, learning paths, and verification.","category":"people-customer","instructions_md":"# Identify Training Needs\n\n**الاسم العربي:** تحديد الاحتياجات التدريبية  \n**المجال:** الموارد البشرية وتجربة العميل\n\n## Mission\n\nMap capability gaps to role outcomes, evidence, learning paths, and verification. Work from authoritative NEXIOS evidence and return an auditable result that a human owner can verify.\n\n## Required inputs\n\n- population and per